<p>                                     <hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#fr">Wornach &#x017F;ich zu                                             achten.</hi></hi>                                 </p>                                 <lb/>
<closer><dateline><hi rendition="#aq">Decretum Kiel in Curia,</hi> <hi rendition="#fr">den 1&#x017F;ten Sept.                                         1812.</hi></dateline>                                     <lb/>
